Coforge Partners with SpaceX Super Intelligence to Drive Enterprise Grok AI Adoption

Indian IT services firm Coforge has joined the SpaceX Super Intelligence (SpaceXSI) Partner Network as a Transformation Partner. The collaboration enables Coforge to deploy xAI’s Grok AI suite—spanning reasoning models, code generation, and workflow automation—into existing enterprise systems. By leveraging its AI-native engineering capabilities, Coforge aims to accelerate enterprise adoption and deliver measurable operational outcomes across key business functions.
